fees, consent may affect only a youth branch; never silently broaden either.\nEach policy must explicitly state complete eligibility, fee/free admission, and deadline/no deadline. No quotas, actual payment collection, queues, IDs, subjective merit, authorization, hidden fields, arithmetic formulas, external data, or arbitrary code. If ANY clause is unsupported, contradictory, ambiguous, missing or not faithfully representable, return rules:null with specific clarification questions in issues. Never partially compile. Executable rules REQUIRE issues:[]; null rules REQUIRE at least one issue. Check negation, age endpoints, nested exceptions, overlapping fee priority, exact time boundaries and complete bilingual meaning before returning. The deterministic checker searches only your structured rules, so their fidelity matters.\n\nExact source snapshot:\n{\"jobId\":\"studio-review-3\",\"drafts\":{\"alice\":\"Watercolor circle. Admission is open exactly to people aged 18 through 72 inclusive who are residents or members, or both. Registration has no deadline. The standard admission price is $46 USD. Residents pay $14 USD. Students pay $7 USD. Scholarship recipients pay $0 USD. These are alternative whole prices, not amounts to add or subtract. There are no other eligibility conditions.\",\"bob\":\"Círculo de acuarela. Pueden participar exactamente las personas de 18 a 72 años, ambos inclusive, que sean residentes o miembros, o las dos cosas. La inscripción no tiene fecha límite. El precio normal de entrada es $46 USD. Las personas residentes pagan $14 USD. Las personas estudiantes pagan $7 USD. Las personas con beca pagan $0 USD. Son precios totales alternativos, no cantidades que se sumen o resten. No hay otras condiciones de admisión.\"}}"
